    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that translates HTML or markup while preserving tags. I will use the Google Translate API for this purpose, as it is a concrete external provider that can be identified in the code. The script will take HTML or markup as input, translate the text content while preserving the tags, and return the translated markup. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
